ional ALU. Its 5.442 MHz Fmax strongly\\nsuggests that the deeply unrolled divide/remainder arithmetic dominates\\nfitness. alu.sv currently expresses signed and unsigned division and\\nremainder separately. Improving this timed arithmetic cone can increase\\nCoreMark iterations/second without changing instruction throughput or\\nadding pipeline control under the approximately 22% memory stalls.\\n\", \"hypothes\n…[24783 of 27855 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:8c1805a5c1537bcc]…\nillegal\\nencodings. Exercise load-use plus prediction and consecutive/random\\nimem/dmem holds, including a MEM stall with a branch in EX. Check exact\\nretired PCs, architectural results, strict RVFI order, absence of\\nwrong-path stores, and no duplicate correction or counter update.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 12.59, \"delta_pct\": 3.88, \"vs_baseline\": 3.88, \"fmax_mhz\": 5.292, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4201766, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 13072, \"ff\": 620, \"seeds\": [4.986, 5.292, 5.292], \"perturbations\": [[0, 4.986, 146], [1, 5.292, 141], [2, 5.292, 141]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_mem/reg_q.rd_0_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -195.565, \"arrival_ns\": 205.859, \"logic_cells\": 153, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_fwd\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 146, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-04T14:14:14.291461Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 1}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
