the largest nonnegative trial. Derive\\nboth each trial's borrow and its candidate remainder from the same\\nsubtraction; avoid a serial comparator followed by a second subtractor.\\nPrecompute the 34-bit D, 2D, and 3D once. Use 35-bit zero-extended trial\\nsubtractions so bit 34 indicates borrow, and retain only the selected\\nlow 32 remainder bits between steps:\n…[134537 of 137609 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:b5d6819f0661ef2e]…\nholds. Check one training event per accepted\\nbranch, exact RVFI PCs/order/operands/links, no wrong-path memory\\nwrites and no bubble for correct predictions. Update only affected\\ndirect-transfer schedule expectations while preserving every existing\\narchitectural and randomized-stall assertion.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"improvement\", \"fitness\": 126.34, \"delta_pct\": 10.9, \"vs_baseline\": 942.41, \"fmax_mhz\": 50.352, \"ipc_coremark\": 3e-06, \"cycles\": 3985515, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3377, \"ff\": 772, \"seeds\": [49.228, 50.352, 50.352], \"perturbations\": [[0, 49.228, 31], [1, 50.352, 31], [2, 50.352, 31]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_div/quotient_q_31_s1\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_div/quotient_q_0_s1\", \"slack_ns\": -15.314, \"arrival_ns\": 25.608, \"logic_cells\": 164, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_div\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 31, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-04T15:51:41.968241Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 4}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
