Derive\\nboth each trial's borrow and its candidate remainder from the same\\nsubtraction; avoid a serial comparator followed by a second subtractor.\\nPrecompute the 34-bit D, 2D, and 3D once. Use 35-bit zero-extended trial\\nsubtractions so bit 34 indicates borrow, and retain only the selected\\nlow 32 remainder bits between steps:\n…[232804 of 235876 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:0fcc5fb920d03703]…\n fetch lookahead, source dependencies, traps, changed instructions at a learned PC and independent bus stalls. Verify accepted training provenance, both recovery directions, absence of wrong-path side effects, exact RVFI operands/targets/links/order and unchanged liveness requirements.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 129.99, \"delta_pct\": -3.42, \"vs_baseline\": 972.52, \"fmax_mhz\": 49.614, \"ipc_coremark\": 3e-06, \"cycles\": 3816810, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 4037, \"ff\": 1114, \"seeds\": [46.115, 49.614, 49.614], \"perturbations\": [[0, 46.115, 18], [1, 49.614, 18], [2, 49.614, 18]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\", \"to\": \"dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -16.685, \"arrival_ns\": 26.98, \"logic_cells\": 18, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_mem\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 18, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-04T17:50:45.872234Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 7}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
