{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"agent_message","text":"The canonical CoreMark trace has only 13,735 returns in the timed region, so a return stack has too little cycle-saving potential on its own. I’m refining the proposal toward registered predictor recovery, which could raise Fmax by cutting the live load-to-branch path into fetch control."}}
