{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"agent_message","text":"The limb prototype reduced DSP use from six to three, but its median Fmax fell to 59.57 MHz. I’m testing a simpler shared native multiplier that avoids the added compressor tree."}}
