g, load-use bubbles, arbitrary bus stalls, WB provenance, multiplier and ordinary ALU, legality/alignment traps, nret=1 IO, exact RVFI operands/results/order and symbolic progress. Do not add state, pipeline stages, phase-indexed data selection or change any evaluation contract.\n\nThe expected gain is shorter native borrow propagation in both dependent body cells at identical instruction and CoreMark cycles. Six percent is a low-confidence forecast; the high-bit eligibility reduction, terminal publication and unchanged EX-to-OF path may prevent acceptance. At unchanged cycles acceptance requires median Gowin Fmax above approximately 73.62 MHz and fitness above 182.92448 iter/sec. Validate every scored placement option, exact real/ALTOPS divider tests, unchanged formal and stalled RVFI cosim, canonical five CRCs and UART validation literal, bounds and MMIO timing.''',\n 'expected_impact':{'fitness_delta_pct':6,'confidence':'low'},\n 'changes':[\n {'file':'rtl/div_unit.sv','description':'Replace only the two full-width shared body digit calls with statically elaborated W=28/W=30 trial subtractors, mandatory full-multiple high-bit eligibility checks, existing digit/mask equations and zero-extended restored remainders. Preserve full-width divisor multiples, state registers, launch/bootstrap/terminal logic and exact real/ALTOPS schedules.'},\n {'file':'test/test_div_unit.py','description':'Add independent integer-reference vectors around 2\"'^28 and 2''^30 trial-eligibility boundaries for D,2D,3D, including oversized multiples with misleading low bits, all radix-4 digits, every body phase, all-ones dividend, zero divisor and signed extrema. Check body window/remainder bounds independently and retain all arithmetic, exact six-clock latency, held READY, rejected-start, reset and consume/relaunch assertions.'\"'},\n {'file':'test/test_pipeline.py','description':'Add divide/rem-to-consumer chains with boundary and large divisors, signed cases and zero divisors under independent memory stalls and redirects. Retain exact RVFI fields/order, eight-cycle consecutive-divide retirement, ten-cycle progress, forwarding age priority and wrong-path divider/side-effect checks.'}\n ]}\np.write_text(yaml.safe_dump(h,sort_keys=False,width=100))\njsonschema.validate(h,json.loads(Path('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json').read_text()))\nprint('Wrote and schema-validated bounded body hypothesis')\nPY\ncat /srv/hwebench/tmp/e4e97874/b737a704/bounded-tests.log; tail -8 cores/bench/generated/timing/gowin_p0/gw.log\"", "aggregated_output": "Wrote and schema-validated bounded body hypothesis\n[10%] Placement Phase 0 completed\n[20%] Placement Phase 1 completed\n[30%] Placement Phase 2 completed\n[50%] Placement Phase 3 completed\nRunning routing......\n[60%] Routing Phase 0 completed\n[70%] Routing Phase 1 completed\n[80%] Routing Phase 2 completed\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
